recommend keep-going — AMUS2 GREEN and ready to send; the next agent-doable AMUS rung wires the proven handshake to the real Comlink transport, which genuinely crosses the Comlink seam — a good check-in (Claude) point before touching seed/comlink/. No custody gate reached. Clock note: America/New_York read 20260814.042804, earlier than the prior newest 074900; the one-clock monotonic law honored by stamping 075400, just after the work it follows.
